  "body": "### Summary\n\nMigration lot LOT-067 (Phase 3 — engine / Storage (`HFRStorage`)): Legacy data import on update (accounts, lists, settings, drafts, smiley favourites, layout), idempotent, never deletes the source; also removes the legacy app caches on first launch (e.g. `Caches/cache/topic-*.htm`).\n\n### Scope\n\nLegacy data import on update (accounts, lists, settings, drafts, smiley favourites, layout), idempotent, never deletes the source; also removes the legacy app caches on first launch (e.g. `Caches/cache/topic-*.htm`)\n\n- Module: HFRStorage · Difficulty: difficult · Priority: medium\n- Audit source: E-7, NET-06\n\n### Depends on\n\nLOT-060 (#85), LOT-061 (#86), LOT-064 (#89), LOT-065 (#90), LOT-004 (#41)\n\n### Blocked by\n\ndependencies not done: LOT-064 (#89) (todo) (derived from LOTS.md dependency/status columns)\n\n### Model\n\nOpus → Fable\n\n### Spec\n\nNo spec file on `dev-swift` yet (`docs/lots/LOT-067-*.md`).\n\n### PRs\n\n- [francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR#15](https://github.com/francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR/pull/15) — Reopen Q-1 and bring back LOT-067 (legacy data import) (merged; related)\n\n### Old issue (frozen)\n\n[francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR#88](https://github.com/francoisgn/ios-app_SwiftHFR/issues/88) — read-only history.\n\n### Owner / session\n\n—\n\n### Status note\n\n`docs/LOTS.md` status cell on 2026-10-27: `blocked`.\n",
