   "body": "Every lot this depends on is now done (LOT-064 merged in #345 as 6874dea). This stays `status: blocked` for one reason: the import reads the legacy on-device formats, and no legacy sample exists in the corpus for super-favourites, the favourites layout, the smiley search history or the upload history (#345 lists them as pending capture; LESSONS 35-36: never hand-build a legacy plist). Those samples must come from the legacy app on the Mac before this is claimed. The steward will propose a capture issue to the operator.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
